<title>SWEDEN: Bofors wins 100 mln skr U.S. ammo order.</title>
<headline>Bofors wins 100 mln skr U.S. ammo order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish defence industries group Bofors, part of the Celsius group, said on Tuesday it had won an order worth around 100 million crowns to supply ammunition for its Carl Gustaf grenade launcher to the U.S. Army.</p>
<p>&quot;The grenade launcher was first acquired in 1989 and the users are very pleased with the system, which has now resulted in a new order worth around 100 million crowns,&quot; Bofors said in a statement.</p>
<p>The order also included fine-calibre ammunition for a practice weapon, it added.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
